  "fideon:status": "SPEC_21 schema built from real CGL documents and the legacy gl.json; 3.0.0 (8 October 2026) adopts common model 1.1.0: the shared X_ codes for additional insured, primary and noncontributory and waiver of subrogation (CR-GL-03), and fields for the concepts 2.0.0 carried as additional_fields (CR-GL-02, CR-GL-12). Draft for the owner's approval; the CGL seed golds are drafted against it once approved. 3.1.0 (23 October 2026) is additive: two coverage codes (GL_SUPPLEMENTARY_PAYMENTS, GL_OWNERS_CONTRACTORS_PROTECTIVE) and printed-name aliases from the recurring wording of the V3 originals; nothing removed or renamed, no new field (the concepts two or more lines print are requested from the common model, CHANGE_REQUESTS_gl.md CR-GL-22). 3.2.0 (26 October 2026, additive): coverage-code names and codes for the coverage rows printed by the G1 scanned and hybrid seed documents (change request approved by the project owner). No path, code or alias is removed or renamed.",
