  "fideon:lob_block": "None. Every concept the CGL documents print has a home in the envelope or a common-model building block (SPEC_21 4.2.4). From 3.0.0 that includes, through common model 1.1.0, the products-completed operations rate and premium of a classification (a second rating_exposures[] row, rating_component products_completed_operations), the minimum earned premium as a percentage (premium.minimum_earned_percent) and the carrier's financial rating (carrier.financial_rating). 1.1.0-1.2.0 held them in a gl block and 2.0.0 in additional_fields. 3.1.0 adds no field and no block: the concepts the V3 originals print that two or more lines share (policy period time, carrier company type, insurer officer signatures, copy designation, terrorism disclosure figures, deductible basis, certificate insurers) are requested from the common model (CR-GL-22) and reach gl through its envelope when released.",
